        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-[#5c5a4c]">China spans four climate zones and every major landform on Earth. Here's how to make sense of it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {landscapes.map((l, i) => (
          <details class={`qa group scroll-reveal overflow-hidden rounded-2xl text-white shadow-sm ${l.gradient}`} open={i < 2}>
            <summary class="cursor-pointer p-6">
              <div class="flex items-start justify-between">
                <i class={`fa-solid ${l.icon} text-2xl opacity-90`}></i>
                <svg class="qa-chevron h-5 w-5 shrink-0 opacity-80" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold leading-tight">{l.name}</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">{l.tagline}</p>
              <img src={l.img} alt={l.imgAlt} class="mt-4 h-36 w-full rounded-xl object-cover shadow-lg" loading="lazy" />
              <p class="mt-4 border-t border-white/25 pt-3 text-xs font-medium text-white/75">{l.places}</p>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-6">
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/95">{l.intro}</p>
              <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
                {l.spots.map((s) => (
                  <div class="rounded-xl bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2">
                      <p class="font-semibold text-white">{s.name}</p>
                      <span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-white/70">{s.season}</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">{s.desc}</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-white/70"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-hiking mr-1"></i>{s.activity}</p>
                    {s.url && (
                      <a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-white/90 transition-colors hover:text-white">
                        Full guide <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]"></i>
                      </a>
                    )}
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
              <p class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-black/20 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/90"><strong class="font-semibold">Best way:</strong> {l.bestWay}</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center">
        <button id="expand-all" class="rounded-full border border-[#d5d0c4] bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[#0f766e] shadow-sm transition-colors hover:border-[#14b8a6] hover:text-[#115e59]">Expand all landscapes</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <script is:inline>
      const expandBtn = document.getElementById("expand-all");
      if (expandBtn) {
        expandBtn.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const cards = document.querySelectorAll("#landscapes details");
          const allOpen = [...cards].every((d) => d.open);
          cards.forEach((d) => { d.open = !allOpen; });
          expandBtn.textContent = allOpen ? "Expand all landscapes" : "Collapse all landscapes";
        });
      }
    </script>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. Compare -->
  <section id="compare" class="relative py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="mb-12 max-w-2xl">
        <span class="tag tag-stone mb-4">The Big Three</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#1c1a16] md:text-5xl">Zhangjiajie vs Guilin vs Jiuzhaigou</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-[#5c5a4c]">The question everyone asks. Here's the honest answer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#d5d0c4]/40 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <table class="w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-[#0f766e] text-left text-white">
              <th class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold"></th>
              {comparison.columns.map((c) => <th class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold">{c}</th>)}
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {comparison.rows.map((row) => (
              <tr class="border-t border-[#d5d0c4]/40">
                <td class="px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-[#0f766e]">{row.label}</td>
                {row.values.map((v) => <td class="px-5 py-4 text-[#5c5a4c]">{v}</td>)}
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <details class="qa mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#d5d0c4]/40 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between p-5">
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-[#0f766e]">More comparisons</span>
          <svg class="qa-chevron h-5 w-5 text-[#14b8a6]" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="space-y-4 px-5 pb-5">
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#f8f7f4] p-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1c1a16]">Guilin vs Yunnan</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5c5a4c]">Guilin is one compact region — perfect for a 3–4 day trip. Yunnan is a whole province — expect a week or more and bigger distances. Pick Guilin for ease; Yunnan for variety (Stone Forest, rice terraces, Shangri-La).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#f8f7f4] p-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1c1a16]">Jiuzhaigou vs Huanglong</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5c5a4c]">Both are Sichuan valleys, often combined in one trip. Jiuzhaigou is bigger, bluer and more famous; Huanglong is a smaller travertine terrace with a gentler walk. Do both in 3 days from Chengdu.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#f8f7f4] p-4">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1c1a16]">Huangshan vs Zhangjiajie</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#5c5a4c]">Huangshan is classic granite scenery — pines, cloud seas and a famous sunrise. Zhangjiajie is alien sandstone pillars and adventure attractions. Pick Huangshan for atmosphere, Zhangjiajie for drama.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. Seasons -->
  <section class="relative bg-[#0f766e] py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <div class="mb-12 max-w-2xl">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">Timing</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl">When to Go</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80">Spring and autumn are the sweet spots — but every season has a landscape.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
